#: tips.cpp:2
msgid "Don't run with scissors."
msgstr "Moenie met 'n sker hardloop nie."

#: tips.cpp:5
msgid "Never trust car salesmen or politicians."
msgstr "Moenie kar verkoopspersone of politikuste vertrou nie."

#: tips.cpp:8
msgid ""
"Real programmers don't comment their code. It was hard to write, it should "
"be hard to understand."
msgstr ""
"Egte programmeerders sit geen kommentaar in hulle kode nie.  Dit was moeilik "
"om te skryf, dit moet moeilik wees om te verstaan."

#: tips.cpp:11
msgid ""
"It is much easier to suggest solutions when you know nothing about the "
"problem."
msgstr ""
"Dit is baie makliker om oplossings voor te stel wanneer jy niks aangaande "
"die probleem weet nie."

#: tips.cpp:14
msgid "You can never have too much memory or disk space."
msgstr "Jy kan nooit te veel geheue of hardeskyf spasie hê nie."

#: tips.cpp:17
msgid "The answer is 42."
msgstr "Die antwoord is 42."

#: tips.cpp:20
msgid "It's not a bug. It's a misfeature."
msgstr "Dis nie n fout nie. Dis 'n waneienskap."

#: tips.cpp:23
msgid "Help stamp out and abolish redundancy."
msgstr "Help om oortolligheid te verwyder en te vernietig."

#: tips.cpp:26
msgid ""
"To maximize a window vertically, click the maximize button with the middle "
"mouse button."
msgstr ""
"Om 'n venster tot sy maksimum vertikale grote te vergroot, druk die "
"maksimerings knoppie met die middel muis knoppie."

#: tips.cpp:29
msgid "You can use Alt+Tab to switch between applications."
msgstr "Jy kan Alt+Tab gebruik om te wissel tussen programme."

#: tips.cpp:32
msgid ""
"Press Ctrl+Esc to show the applications running in your current session."
msgstr ""
"Druk Ctrl+Esc om die programme wat loop in jou huidige sessie  te vertoon."

#: tips.cpp:35
msgid "Alt+F2 displays a small window that you can type a command into."
msgstr "Alt+F2 vertoon 'n klein venster waarin jy 'n opdrag kan tik."

#: tips.cpp:38
msgid "Ctrl+F1 to Ctrl+F8 can be used to switch virtual desktops."
msgstr ""
"Ctrl+F1 tot Ctrl+F8 kan gebruik word om tussen virtuele werkskerms te wissel."

#: tips.cpp:41
msgid "You can move buttons on the panel using the middle mouse button."
msgstr ""
"Jy kan knoppies op die paneel rondskuif deur die middelste muis knoppie te "
"gebruik."

#: tips.cpp:44
msgid "Alt+F1 pops-up the system menu."
msgstr "Alt+F1 bring die stelsel kieslys op."

#: tips.cpp:47
msgid ""
"Ctrl+Alt+Esc can be used to kill an application that has stopped responding."
msgstr ""
"Ctrl+Alt+Esc kan gebruik work om 'n program te stop wat nie meer reageer nie."

#: tips.cpp:50
msgid ""
"If you leave KDE applications open when you logout, they will be restarted "
"automatically when you log back in."
msgstr ""
"As jy KDE programme oop los wanneer jy af teken, sal hulle automaties weer "
"herlaai wanneer jy in teken."

#: tips.cpp:53
msgid "The KDE file manager is also a web browser and an FTP client."
msgstr "Die KDE lêerbestuurder is 'n web blaaier asook 'n ftp kliënt."

#: tips.cpp:56
msgid ""
"Applications can display messages and tips in an Amor bubble using the "
"showMessage() and\n"
"showTip() DCOP calls"
msgstr ""
"Programme kan boodskappe en leidrade in 'n Amor notifikasie wys deur die "
"\"showMessage()\" en \"showTip()\" DCOP metodes."

